  "title": "Texas Twinkies",
  "description": "Texas Twinkies are bacon-wrapped jalapeño poppers stuffed with cream cheese and tender beef brisket, smothered in BBQ sauce for a crowd-pleasing snack.",
  "authors": [
    "burtvilla"
  ],
